<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>价格与计费 - 口袋助手</title>
<meta name="description" content="口袋助手价格与计费说明：工具运行 <%= billing.enabledRatePerHour %> 点/小时（满 24 小时 = <%= billing.disabledRatePerDay %> 点/天）；每日最低消费 <%= billing.dailyMinimum %> 点/天；月卡、季卡、半年卡、年卡点数套餐。">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/home.css">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#4f7cff">
<meta name="robots" content="index,follow">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://koudai.binjia70.workers.dev/pricing">
<meta name="keywords" content="口袋助手价格,点数计费,月卡,季卡,半年卡,年卡,点数套餐">
